    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Photograph and video every angle of the motorcycle, noting scratches, dents, and accessories. Store the files in a dated folder and share a copy with the moving team (packers Jaipur city) to create a verifiable record that can be referenced at delivery.</p>
