    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the tank to roughly 25 % of capacity. This amount is enough to avoid fuel starvation while keeping weight low and complying with most rail and road transport policies, including those of the best bike transport providers.</p>
