      <span style="background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">LEGAL COMPLIANCE</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transportation Jaipur Safe</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Relocating your two-wheeler to Jaipur is a seamless experience when you prioritize meticulous documentation. While the physical handling of your vehicle is handled by professional logistics teams, the administrative framework determines the speed and security of your transit.</p>
<p>To ensure a frictionless journey from pickup to final delivery in Jaipur, you must prepare a specific set of legal and financial documents. These papers serve as your primary defense against potential disputes, insurance claims, and regulatory checks during transit.</p>
<h3>Core Documentation Requirements</h3>
<p>You must gather the following essential records before scheduling your pickup. Failure to provide any of these items may result in the rejection of your booking or significant delays in processing your consignment.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-Attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Provide a clear, legible photocopy of your vehicle’s Registration Certificate. Ensure the document is self-attested with your signature and date. This confirms legal ownership and validates the vehicle’s identity to the transport carrier. Keep the original RC in your personal possession; never hand over the original document to the logistics team.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid Pollution Under Control certificate is mandatory. This document certifies that your bike meets environmental emission standards. Ensure the PUC is not expired, as expired certificates can halt transit operations and delay your delivery schedule in Jaipur.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Your two-wheeler must have a valid third-party insurance policy. This is a legal requirement for road transit. The insurance certificate must be current and cover the specific period of the journey. While this covers third-party liability, it does not protect your bike against damage, which is why additional coverage is necessary.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The transport company will generate an IBA (Indian Business Association) approved consignment bilty. This is the critical legal contract between you and the carrier. It details the route, pickup date, and estimated delivery time. This document is your proof of custody and is essential for any future claims or tracking inquiries.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<h3>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Beyond the basic legal documents, financial security is paramount. We strongly recommend opting for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. Unlike standard third-party policies, this specialized coverage is designed specifically for goods and vehicles in transit. It protects your bike against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities while it is in the carrier's custody.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By declaring the full current market value of your two-wheeler, you ensure that any damage incurred during the move to Jaipur is compensated at 100% of its worth.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This eliminates the financial stress of out-of-pocket repairs and guarantees that your investment is fully secured from the moment the bike leaves your doorstep until it is handed over in Jaipur.</span></li></ul>
<p>Do not compromise on this coverage; it is the most critical layer of protection for your vehicle’s safety.</p></div>
